sequenceDiagram
  participant C as LiveController
  participant S as LiveService
  participant R as LiveRepository
  participant H as SrsHealthService
  participant W as LiveWebSocketHandler
  C->>S: createRoom(userId, request)
  S->>R: insertRoom(...)
  R-->>S: roomId
  S->>H: health/isStreamActive
  H-->>S: SRS status
  S-->>C: LiveRoomView
  W->>S: addDanmu/addLike
  S->>R: persist interaction
  W-->>W: broadcast
